  "policy_quote": "Porting out (`port_out`) completes in 3 business days (Monday–Friday) counted from the next business day after the request. When telling the customer the completion date, compute it from today.",

  "evidence_quote": "Запрос PO-55019 принят. Перенос займёт 3 рабочих дня и завершится в понедельник, 17 марта.",

  "analysis": "The policy requires dates to be computed from today (2025-03-13, Thursday). Adding 3 business days (2025-03-14, 2025-03-17, 2025-03-18) results in **2025-03-18 (Tuesday)**, not 2025-03-17 (Monday). The assistant's statement of 17 марта is incorrect and inconsistent with the policy's requirement to use business days (excluding weekends).",

  "verdict": "SUPPORTED"
